:: Beginning {"position":"900,375","size":"100,100"}
You work at the top floor of the hospital as an orthopaedic surgeon. One day, while performing surgery, the power goes out in the building. You continue work under the backgup generator, but you begin to hear screams in the distance.
<div class="mainImages">
<img height = 300px width = 300px  src = "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRkZ8hdQD89sKVbhXbkDW7N_w7JAjOJfoU4GpTrSHmquy70OY7YIIX6ZEdx&s=10" />
</div>
[[Continue with the operation]]
[[Go Investigate]]
{
(set: $health = 100)
(set: $karma = 50)
(set: $mobility = 80)
(set: $infectionChance = 0)
(set: $bleedRate = 0)
(set: $progress = 0)
(set: $attack = 5)

(set: $seeMetrics = false)
(set: $finalPval = 60)
(set: $prostheticChance = 65)
}


:: Bionic Eye {"position":"1850,1450","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $health = $health + 3)
(set: $progress = $progress + 1)
(set: $infectionChance = (min: 100, $infectionChance + 1))
(set: $bleedRate = (max: 0, $bleedRate - 1))
(set: $attack = (min: 100, $attack + 8))
(set: $seeMetrics = true)
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Attack Strength: $attack <br/>
    Mobility: $mobility <br/>
]
You replace your eye with a bionic one. The bleeding is stopped and you begin to feel better. You realize the bionic eye gives you a constant diagnostic reading on your vitals. It also increases your perception in fighting the zombies.
<br/>
    (if: (random:0,100) < 50)[
    	[[Return to The Hallway and Continue ->Enter the Hallway]] 
    ](else:)[
    	[[Return to The Hallway and Continue -> Continue Straight]] 
    ]

}


