:: Continue with the operation {"position":"900,500","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $karma = $karma + 25)

You cannot abandon the patient in the middle of an operation. You complete the hip replacement surgery as the noises become increasingly distressing. You are just sewing the patient up when you hear crashing noises and more screams very near the room you are in. 
<div class="mainImages">
<img height = 300px width = 300px src = "https://media.istockphoto.com/id/1251257207/vector/surgical-team-performing-operation-on-patient-in-hospital.jpg?s=612x612&w=0&k=20&c=7oT35x0I92WFgKafibNCeYWYgUjKtljhC-nwk2o66M0=" />
</div>
<br/>
[[Enter the Hallway]]
}


