    	You stumble in and slam the door behind you. As you do, you see your arm is a torn up disaster. You have some of your prosthetic replacements in the room with you to swap out if you wish. <br/>
        <div class="mainImages">
<img height = 300px width = 300px src = "https://cdn.pixabay.com/photo/2012/04/13/00/08/robotic-31136_640.png" />
</div>
        [[Go on as is]] <br/>
        [[Titanium arm implant]] <br/>
        [[Bionic arm]] <br/>
    ] (else-if: $limbLost is 3)[
    	Your vision continues to get blurrier as the door clicks closed behind you. You look into a nearby mirror and see your eye is ruined. You see some replacement options on the shelf next to you
        <div class="mainImages">
<img height = 300px width = 300px src = "https://cdn.pixabay.com/photo/2013/07/12/18/41/android-153695_640.png" />
</div>
        [[Go on as is]]  <br/>
        [[Bionic Eye]] <br/>
        [[Glass Eye]] <br/>
    ] (else-if: $limbLost is 4)[
    	Your already poor heart health has begun to overwhelm you. You can feel your heart starting to fail..
        [[Go on as is]]  <br/>
        [[Attach a pacemaker]] <br/>
        [[Connect to the Heart Lung Machine]] <br/>
    ]
] 
}


