The implant is very well attached, increasing your mobility while lessening the bleeding.
<br/>
    (if: (random:0,100) < 50)[
    	[[Return to The Hallway and Continue ->Enter the Hallway]] 
    ](else:)[
    	[[Return to The Hallway and Continue -> Continue Straight]] 
    ]

}


